# Hostile Investigator watches every player's discards, its controller's own included, and "one or more cards" is one trigger
# however many are discarded (CR 603.2c). Turn 1: its enters ability makes Bot2 discard the Plains and the first Clue. Turn 3:
# Bot1's Faithless Looting draws two and discards two (Swamp and Swamp) at once: exactly one more Clue, two in all.

